{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "Guitar-to-Synth",
  "settings": {
    "sample_rate": 48000,
    "length": 10.0,
    "seed": 0,
    "block_size": 256,
    "tempo": [
      {
        "beat": 0.0,
        "bpm": 120.0,
        "time_sig": [
          4,
          4
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "1",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "Play a guitar and hear a synth follow you. Plug a guitar into input 1 of your audio interface, pick it in the Devices tab, and switch on Guitar in. Until then a recorded riff stands in, so the patch plays when you press Space (and when it's rendered).\n\nPitch Detect hears which note you play and tunes two oscillators to it; an Envelope Follower hears how hard you play and sets the synth's volume and brightness. Play single notes: Pitch Detect follows one note at a time."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            -312.0
          ],
          "size": [
            760.0,
            128.0
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "2",
        "kind": "audio_in",
        "config": {
          "channel": 0,
          "channels": 1
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Guitar"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "3",
        "kind": "clip",
        "config": {
          "file": "assets/lead.wav",
          "channels": 1
        },
        "params": {
          "loop": true
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            110.0
          ],
          "label": "Demo riff"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "4",
        "kind": "toggle",
        "params": {
          "value": false
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            270.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Guitar in"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "5",
        "kind": "switch",
        "config": {
          "type": "audio"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            270.0,
            150.0
          ],
          "label": "Source"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "6",
        "kind": "pitch_detect",
        "params": {
          "max_freq": 1400.0,
          "min_freq": 70.0,
          "threshold": 0.75
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            560.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Pitch Detect"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "7",
        "kind": "smooth",
        "params": {
          "fall": 0.015,
          "mode": "exponential",
          "rise": 0.015
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            830.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Glide"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "8",
        "kind": "math",
        "params": {
          "b": 0.5,
          "op": "multiply"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            830.0,
            160.0
          ],
          "label": "Octave down"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "9",
        "kind": "oscillator",
        "params": {
          "shape": "saw",
          "start": "load",
          "stop": "never"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1100.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Saw"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "a",
        "kind": "oscillator",
        "params": {
          "shape": "square",
          "start": "load",
          "stop": "never"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1100.0,
            260.0
          ],
          "label": "Sub"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "b",
        "kind": "mix",
        "config": {
          "inputs": 2
        },
        "params": {
          "gain_0": -6.0,
          "gain_1": -10.0
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1370.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Oscillators"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "c",
        "kind": "envelope_follower",
        "params": {
          "attack": 0.003,
          "mode": "peak",
          "release": 0.12
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            560.0,
            620.0
          ],
          "label": "How hard"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "d",
        "kind": "map",
        "params": {
          "curve": "exponential",
          "in_max": 0.5,
          "in_min": 0.0,
          "out_max": 6000.0,
          "out_min": 250.0
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            830.0,
            620.0
          ],
          "label": "Brightness"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "e",
        "kind": "math",
        "params": {
          "b": 3.0,
          "op": "add"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            830.0,
            840.0
          ],
          "label": "Synth level (dB)"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "f",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "level (0 to 1) opens the filter through Brightness; level_db goes straight into the Gain, which takes decibels, so the synth swells and fades with your playing and goes silent between notes (a Gain is off at −60 dB)."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1100.0,
            620.0
          ],
          "size": [
            466.0,
            96.0
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "10",
        "kind": "svf",
        "params": {
          "resonance": 0.35
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1640.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Filter"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "11",
        "kind": "gain",
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1910.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Volume"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "12",
        "kind": "mix",
        "config": {
          "inputs": 2
        },
        "params": {
          "gain_0": 0.0,
          "gain_1": -12.0
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            2180.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Synth + dry"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "13",
        "kind": "meter",
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            2450.0,
            0.0
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "14",
        "kind": "audio_out",
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            2720.0,
            0.0
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "15",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "Try this:\n• Change Octave down's b to 2 for an octave up, or to 1.5 for a fifth above.\n• Lengthen Glide to 0.1 s for portamento between notes.\n• Wire Pitch Detect's confidence through a Compare (greater than 0.6) and a Switch to mute the synth whenever the pitch is unclear.\n• Wire onset into an ADSR and multiply it in for a fresh attack on every note.\n• Turn Synth + dry's gain_1 up to hear the guitar under the synth."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1640.0,
            300.0
          ],
          "size": [
            560.0,
            144.0
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
